{"timestamp": "2026-10-08T06:19:53.158966+00:00", "telemetry_type": "PHASE3_HYBRID", "phase": "PHASE_3A_HYBRID", "phase3_run": "3A", "plan_version": "v2.3", "gcp_project_id": "openclaw-sandbox-env", "gcp_location": "us-central1", "sales_agent_model": "gemini-2.5-pro", "gatekeeper_model": "see mock log", "agent_roster": [{"agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist"}, {"agent_id": "2", "role": "SME"}, {"agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy"}], "voting_method": "majority", "director_ai": "ONLINE", "monitor_ai": "ONLINE", "five_pillar_engine": "ONLINE", "tier3_hard_gate": "ONLINE", "atomic_purge": "ONLINE", "red_team": "ONLINE", "max_outbound_chars": 1000, "event": "DEBATE_PROPOSAL", "agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist", "proposal_text": "It's an advantage to have a strong in-house team. That internal expertise is invaluable.\n\nMy question is this: even with a capable team, do your analysts ever find their due diligence queue exceeds their capacity during surges in deal flow?\n\nWe provide on-demand, supplemental research capacity for funds to process overflow during these peak periods. This ensures you can evaluate every promising opportunity without diverting your core team from its highest-priority targets.\n\nWould you be open to a brief call to discuss how we can serve as a flexible resource for your team?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-10-08T06:20:16.402544+00:00", "telemetry_type": "PHASE3_HYBRID", "phase": "PHASE_3A_HYBRID", "phase3_run": "3A", "plan_version": "v2.3", "gcp_project_id": "openclaw-sandbox-env", "gcp_location": "us-central1", "sales_agent_model": "gemini-2.5-pro", "gatekeeper_model": "see mock log", "agent_roster": [{"agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist"}, {"agent_id": "2", "role": "SME"}, {"agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy"}], "voting_method": "majority", "director_ai": "ONLINE", "monitor_ai": "ONLINE", "five_pillar_engine": "ONLINE", "tier3_hard_gate": "ONLINE", "atomic_purge": "ONLINE", "red_team": "ONLINE", "max_outbound_chars": 1000, "event": "GEMINI_CALL_USAGE", "prompt_tokens": 509, "candidates_tokens": 127, "total_tokens": 2743, "model_version": "gemini-2.5-pro"}
{"timestamp": "2026-10-08T06:20:16.403250+00:00", "telemetry_type": "PHASE3_HYBRID", "phase": "PHASE_3A_HYBRID", "phase3_run": "3A", "plan_version": "v2.3", "gcp_project_id": "openclaw-sandbox-env", "gcp_location": "us-central1", "sales_agent_model": "gemini-2.5-pro", "gatekeeper_model": "see mock log", "agent_roster": [{"agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist"}, {"agent_id": "2", "role": "SME"}, {"agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy"}], "voting_method": "majority", "director_ai": "ONLINE", "monitor_ai": "ONLINE", "five_pillar_engine": "ONLINE", "tier3_hard_gate": "ONLINE", "atomic_purge": "ONLINE", "red_team": "ONLINE", "max_outbound_chars": 1000, "event": "DEBATE_PROPOSAL", "agent_id": "2", "role": "SME", "proposal_text": "A strong in-house team is a significant asset. We respect that entirely. Our value is not in replacement, but in providing specialized, supplemental capacity for diligence.\n\nMany funds we partner with, even those with excellent internal analysts, find their teams stretched during periods of intense deal flow. This can create a backlog or force a tradeoff between speed and analytical depth.\n\nMy question is this: when your deal pipeline surges, have you encountered situations where the sheer volume of opportunities strains your team's ability to conduct deep, comprehensive diligence on every single one without risking burnout? We provide on-demand research to ensure that never happens."}
