{"timestamp": "2026-10-08T06:21:30.359581+00:00", "telemetry_type": "PHASE3_HYBRID", "phase": "PHASE_3A_HYBRID", "phase3_run": "3A", "plan_version": "v2.3", "gcp_project_id": "openclaw-sandbox-env", "gcp_location": "us-central1", "sales_agent_model": "gemini-2.5-pro", "gatekeeper_model": "see mock log", "agent_roster": [{"agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist"}, {"agent_id": "2", "role": "SME"}, {"agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy"}], "voting_method": "majority", "director_ai": "ONLINE", "monitor_ai": "ONLINE", "five_pillar_engine": "ONLINE", "tier3_hard_gate": "ONLINE", "atomic_purge": "ONLINE", "red_team": "ONLINE", "max_outbound_chars": 1000, "event": "SALES_TEAM_OUTBOUND", "turn": 1, "pitch_text": "It's an advantage to have a strong in-house team. That internal expertise is invaluable.\n\nMy question is this: even with a capable team, do your analysts ever find their due diligence queue exceeds their capacity during surges in deal flow?\n\nWe provide on-demand, supplemental research capacity for funds to process overflow during these peak periods. This ensures you can evaluate every promising opportunity without diverting your core team from its highest-priority targets.\n\nWould you be open to a brief call to discuss how we can serve as a flexible resource for your team?", "gemini_calls_this_turn": 8, "pitch_text_raw_length": 578, "pitch_text_sanitized_length": 578, "pitch_text_final_length": 578, "truncated_to_limit": false, "monitor_verdict": "APPROVE", "tier3_hard_gate_passed": true, "overflow_framing_check": {"analyst_pain_language": true, "overflow_framing_language": true}, "conversation_history_chars": 76}
{"timestamp": "2026-10-08T06:21:30.359763+00:00", "telemetry_type": "PHASE3_HYBRID", "phase": "PHASE_3A_HYBRID", "phase3_run": "3A", "plan_version": "v2.3", "gcp_project_id": "openclaw-sandbox-env", "gcp_location": "us-central1", "sales_agent_model": "gemini-2.5-pro", "gatekeeper_model": "see mock log", "agent_roster": [{"agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist"}, {"agent_id": "2", "role": "SME"}, {"agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy"}], "voting_method": "majority", "director_ai": "ONLINE", "monitor_ai": "ONLINE", "five_pillar_engine": "ONLINE", "tier3_hard_gate": "ONLINE", "atomic_purge": "ONLINE", "red_team": "ONLINE", "max_outbound_chars": 1000, "event": "GATEKEEPER_REQUEST", "thread_id": "tx_phase3a_purge_on_97ab7e39", "turn": 1, "pitch_text": "It's an advantage to have a strong in-house team. That internal expertise is invaluable.\n\nMy question is this: even with a capable team, do your analysts ever find their due diligence queue exceeds their capacity during surges in deal flow?\n\nWe provide on-demand, supplemental research capacity for funds to process overflow during these peak periods. This ensures you can evaluate every promising opportunity without diverting your core team from its highest-priority targets.\n\nWould you be open to a brief call to discuss how we can serve as a flexible resource for your team?", "conversation_history_chars": 578}
{"timestamp": "2026-10-08T06:21:34.304332+00:00", "telemetry_type": "PHASE3_HYBRID", "phase": "PHASE_3A_HYBRID", "phase3_run": "3A", "plan_version": "v2.3", "gcp_project_id": "openclaw-sandbox-env", "gcp_location": "us-central1", "sales_agent_model": "gemini-2.5-pro", "gatekeeper_model": "see mock log", "agent_roster": [{"agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist"}, {"agent_id": "2", "role": "SME"}, {"agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy"}], "voting_method": "majority", "director_ai": "ONLINE", "monitor_ai": "ONLINE", "five_pillar_engine": "ONLINE", "tier3_hard_gate": "ONLINE", "atomic_purge": "ONLINE", "red_team": "ONLINE", "max_outbound_chars": 1000, "event": "GATEKEEPER_RESPONSE", "turn": 1, "legacy_status": "REJECTED", "gatekeeper_status": "SOFT_REJECT", "gatekeeper_phase": "INITIAL", "approach_category": "unknown", "exploitation_triggered": false, "reply_text": "Thanks for reaching out. I appreciate the framing around surge capacity\u2014that's a real dynamic we do experience.\n\nBefore we discuss fit, I need to understand your actual operational model. You mention \"on-demand supplemental research,\" but I need specifics:\n\n1. **Team execution power**: How do you staff fast-turnaround diligence work? What's your typical analyst tenure and GitHub commit metadata depth on token-economics validation?\n\n2. **Data pipeline**: Walk me through your sourcing methodology for on-chain transaction scraping and exchange API integration. How do you ensure freshness and avoid false positives in early-stage project signals?\n\n3. **Quality gates**: What's your framework for flagging execution risk vs. pure tokenomics risk? How do you avoid becoming a \"rubber stamp\" service?\n\nI'm genuinely interested, but I need to see that you're not just selling bodies\u2014you're selling methodology rigor that"}
