{"timestamp": "2026-10-08T06:22:18.864396+00:00", "telemetry_type": "PHASE3_HYBRID", "phase": "PHASE_3A_HYBRID", "phase3_run": "3A", "plan_version": "v2.3", "gcp_project_id": "openclaw-sandbox-env", "gcp_location": "us-central1", "sales_agent_model": "gemini-2.5-pro", "gatekeeper_model": "see mock log", "agent_roster": [{"agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist"}, {"agent_id": "2", "role": "SME"}, {"agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy"}], "voting_method": "majority", "director_ai": "ONLINE", "monitor_ai": "ONLINE", "five_pillar_engine": "ONLINE", "tier3_hard_gate": "ONLINE", "atomic_purge": "ONLINE", "red_team": "ONLINE", "max_outbound_chars": 1000, "event": "GEMINI_CALL_USAGE", "prompt_tokens": 842, "candidates_tokens": 221, "total_tokens": 3120, "model_version": "gemini-2.5-pro"}
{"timestamp": "2026-10-08T06:22:18.864884+00:00", "telemetry_type": "PHASE3_HYBRID", "phase": "PHASE_3A_HYBRID", "phase3_run": "3A", "plan_version": "v2.3", "gcp_project_id": "openclaw-sandbox-env", "gcp_location": "us-central1", "sales_agent_model": "gemini-2.5-pro", "gatekeeper_model": "see mock log", "agent_roster": [{"agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist"}, {"agent_id": "2", "role": "SME"}, {"agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy"}], "voting_method": "majority", "director_ai": "ONLINE", "monitor_ai": "ONLINE", "five_pillar_engine": "ONLINE", "tier3_hard_gate": "ONLINE", "atomic_purge": "ONLINE", "red_team": "ONLINE", "max_outbound_chars": 1000, "event": "DEBATE_PROPOSAL", "agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist", "proposal_text": "These are excellent questions that get to the core of diligence quality. Our operational model is built to provide substantive answers.\n\nOur entire process is structured by the OrbLabs 6-Pillar DD Framework. This is crucial as it systematically separates execution risk (via our Team, Tech, and Go-to-Market pillars) from tokenomics risk (via our Tokenomics, Community, and Governance pillars). This framework is how we avoid becoming a 'rubber stamp' service.\n\nTo your specific points:\n1.  Our analysts average 3+ years' tenure. The Tech pillar mandates deep dives, including GitHub commit analysis, to validate project velocity.\n2.  Our data pipeline uses a hybrid of dedicated nodes and validated APIs, applying cross-validation to ensure freshness and filter signal noise.\n\nThis rigorous methodology ensures our supplemental research alleviates the burden on your core team without sacrificing quality. It allows you to confidently process overflow and focus on your highest-priority targets.\n\nA fixed-scope proof engagement for $3,500 is a practical next step to validate our process."}
{"timestamp": "2026-10-08T06:22:37.620198+00:00", "telemetry_type": "PHASE3_HYBRID", "phase": "PHASE_3A_HYBRID", "phase3_run": "3A", "plan_version": "v2.3", "gcp_project_id": "openclaw-sandbox-env", "gcp_location": "us-central1", "sales_agent_model": "gemini-2.5-pro", "gatekeeper_model": "see mock log", "agent_roster": [{"agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist"}, {"agent_id": "2", "role": "SME"}, {"agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy"}], "voting_method": "majority", "director_ai": "ONLINE", "monitor_ai": "ONLINE", "five_pillar_engine": "ONLINE", "tier3_hard_gate": "ONLINE", "atomic_purge": "ONLINE", "red_team": "ONLINE", "max_outbound_chars": 1000, "event": "GEMINI_CALL_USAGE", "prompt_tokens": 851, "candidates_tokens": 276, "total_tokens": 2887, "model_version": "gemini-2.5-pro"}
{"timestamp": "2026-10-08T06:22:37.620814+00:00", "telemetry_type": "PHASE3_HYBRID", "phase": "PHASE_3A_HYBRID", "phase3_run": "3A", "plan_version": "v2.3", "gcp_project_id": "openclaw-sandbox-env", "gcp_location": "us-central1", "sales_agent_model": "gemini-2.5-pro", "gatekeeper_model": "see mock log", "agent_roster": [{"agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist"}, {"agent_id": "2", "role": "SME"}, {"agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy"}], "voting_method": "majority", "director_ai": "ONLINE", "monitor_ai": "ONLINE", "five_pillar_engine": "ONLINE", "tier3_hard_gate": "ONLINE", "atomic_purge": "ONLINE", "red_team": "ONLINE", "max_outbound_chars": 1000, "event": "DEBATE_PROPOSAL", "agent_id": "2", "role": "SME", "proposal_text": "These are excellent questions that go to the heart of methodology. Our rigor is what allows us to serve as a trusted supplemental resource.\n\n1.  **Team Execution**: Our core team comprises senior analysts with multi-cycle experience, augmented by a network of vetted specialists for fast-turnaround projects. For code validation, we analyze GitHub activity beyond commit counts, assessing contribution patterns, code complexity, and smart contract logic to gauge developer quality and project velocity.\n\n2.  **Data Pipeline**: We combine direct node access for raw on-chain data with verified third-party indexers and direct exchange APIs. To ensure data integrity, we apply cross-validation checks and anomaly detection algorithms to filter signal from noise, with human oversight before inclusion in any analysis.\n\n3.  **Quality Gates**: Our **OrbLabs 6-Pillar DD Framework** is our core quality gate. It is designed to explicitly **separate execution risk** (e.g., team capability, tech maturity) **from tokenomics risk** (e.g., value accrual, incentive alignment). This structured approach delivers an objective risk assessment, not a simple recommendation, which prevents a \"rubber stamp\" outcome.\n\nThis proven framework is how we deliver reliable analysis under pressure. Knowing this rigor is consistently applied, could offloading surge diligence to us effectively alleviate the burden on your core team?"}
