{"timestamp": "2026-10-08T06:23:04.982916+00:00", "telemetry_type": "PHASE3_HYBRID", "phase": "PHASE_3A_HYBRID", "phase3_run": "3A", "plan_version": "v2.3", "gcp_project_id": "openclaw-sandbox-env", "gcp_location": "us-central1", "sales_agent_model": "gemini-2.5-pro", "gatekeeper_model": "see mock log", "agent_roster": [{"agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist"}, {"agent_id": "2", "role": "SME"}, {"agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy"}], "voting_method": "majority", "director_ai": "ONLINE", "monitor_ai": "ONLINE", "five_pillar_engine": "ONLINE", "tier3_hard_gate": "ONLINE", "atomic_purge": "ONLINE", "red_team": "ONLINE", "max_outbound_chars": 1000, "event": "DEBATE_PROPOSAL", "agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy", "proposal_text": "Excellent questions. Our rigor is guided by the OrbLabs 6-Pillar DD Framework:\n\n1. **Team:** A core team of senior analysts manages a vetted specialist network for fast turnaround. We analyze code and commit activity as a key part of our 'Technical Viability' assessment.\n\n2. **Data:** We combine direct node access with normalized exchange API feeds. All data is cross-validated to ensure freshness and reduce false positives.\n\n3. **Quality:** Our framework inherently separates execution risk (assessed via 'Team & Governance' and 'Technical Viability' pillars) from tokenomics risk (its own 'Tokenomics & Value Accrual' pillar). This multi-gate process is our defense against being a rubber stamp.\n\nThis structure ensures our supplemental research meets your standards, alleviating the burden on your core team during deal surges.\n\nWould a fixed-scope, $3,500 proof-of-concept engagement be a logical next step to validate our process?"}
